==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|jebati|lang=sh}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|h₃yebʰ-|lang=sh}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|οἴφω|sc=Grek|tr=oíphō}}, Sanskrit {{term|यभति|sc=Deva|tr=yabhati|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jěbati/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|је|ба|ти}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=јѐбати|c|jebati|jèbati}} {{pf}} and {{impf}}

# {{vulgar|lang=sh}} to [[fuck]]

